<Base title="About Us" description="Our calling to preserve and nurture daily prayer.">
  <section class="page-head wrap">
    <h1>Our calling to preserve and nurture <em>daily prayer</em></h1>
  </section>
  <section class="narrow">
    <p>PrayerHabit was born from a simple conviction: that the habit of prayer is the foundation of a peaceful, steadfast Christian walk. In an era marked by constant digital noise and frantic distraction, our hearts frequently lose their spiritual center. We created this space to offer a tranquil haven where believers can pause, breathe, and encounter timeless prayers crafted by faithful saints across centuries.</p>
    <p>We believe that reading how prior generations cried out to God—in grief, in grateful worship, and in daily petition—gives voice to our own unspoken longings. By curating both contemporary reflections and high-resolution scans of original handwritten prayers, we hope to demystify prayer and guide you into an intimate, unhurried daily conversation with your Creator.</p>
    <img class="rounded" src="/images/antique_leather_prayer_book.webp" alt="An antique leather prayer book" width="1024" height="768" loading="lazy" style="margin-top:2rem" />
  </section>
</Base>
